  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "約束の品は用意してきたよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "了解だ\r\nじゃあ手筈どおり、まずは高台に向かおう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ごめんな\r\n咲耶に余計早起きさせちゃって……──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おやおや、謝るなんてやめてほしいな\r\nこれは私の望みだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタと一緒に朝食をとりたかったんだ\r\n叶えてもらえて感謝こそすれ、謝罪されるだなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それこそ困ってしまう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもほら、俺の分のお弁当も\r\n作ってもらっちゃってるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ひとり分もふたり分もたいして変わらないさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタを思って支度ができる分、\r\n普段よりも心弾む料理だったよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──まぁ、簡単なもので悪いのだけれどね",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶はすぐ俺を甘やかすなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──じゃあ、その気遣いを受けるとして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "0000",
    "se": "0492",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "0008",
    "se": "0345",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 6000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうな\r\n朝ご飯に誘ってくれたことも、準備してくれたことも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺、今日を楽しみにしてたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110150",
    "autoWaitTime": 2700
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……こちらこそ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私だって、まるで遠足前の子どものように\r\n指折り数えて待っていたんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、ほんとか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当だとも",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "朝からアナタを独り占めできるなんて\r\nそうないことだからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\n言ってくれればいつだって付き合うぞ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今度は俺がご飯用意しようか\r\n……出来合いのものになると思うけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110200",
    "autoWaitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……簡単にそんなことを言っていいのかな？\r\nこれから毎朝予約されたらどうするつもりだい？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "毎朝かぁ……！　なかなか攻めるな\r\nでももちろん約束は破らないよ、咲耶が飽きるまで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ひどい人だな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "仕事前に、とんだ爆弾を落としてくれる……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601311/2006013110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……？！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013110250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、いや",
